  "amendmentReason": "Before any real-model run, bind the official ICAE golden repositories, authoritative tests, and hidden PRD archives by source URL and SHA256 in the benchmark lock. The encrypted acquisition completed before any API credential was installed, so no model outcome was observed before this amendment. Amendments 1 and 2 remain documented in eval/v0.4/README.md.",
